# Telos, the polar plateau (TSL, 261TEL): shot down, the party wakes
# (Atton and Kreia; Bao-Dur out cold in the wreck), HK-50's three units
# talk and are fought, their remains searched (DSimpson: the HK Control
# Cluster's second part), and on to the small door at the plateau's centre,
# where the Handmaiden sisters come out to take the party in. Starts from
# the shuttle's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_polar data/routes/tsl/telos_polar.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Telos - Hidden Base" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
talk                 # the crash: the party wakes on the plateau
talk                 # the three HK-50s: asked why, then the fight
fight 30
use HK501            # their remains
use HK502
use HK503
to 261ExitDlgTrigger # the small door: the sisters come out, the party
talk                 # taken in
module 262tel
save telos_academy
